---

This project re-implements, rather than imports, the register map,
sign-magnitude encoding and calibration algorithm used by LeRobot
(https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot), which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. No LeRobot source code is vendored here; see
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for which files were used as a reference and why the
dependency was deliberately avoided.
